  "notes": "LILYGO T3 STM32 PINMAP, board silkscreen T3-STM32 V1.0. Callout names on the side headers are the labels; silkscreen spelling UART_TX/UART_RX differs from callouts TXD/RXD. Several callouts render with a gap after the underscore (e.g. 'TIM2_ CH1'); recorded without the space. Skipped: LoRa IPEX antenna, solar input connector (pins unlabeled), JST-PH battery (+/- only), USB-C, LEDs, OLED and TF-card function tables (no pin positions)."
